# Issue #2903 (P20, greenfield flag day): container mutations, recitations,
# organization root creates and document link/unlink requests no longer
# carry the access manifest the API derives; they send expectedManifestHash
# alone. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains the new
# contract.
